Hmm, but actually maybe it's cleaner to keep the existing map on re-open. Let me keep idempotent.

Let me also consider: should the error for unknown tool have a specific code? The protocol.mjs uses `error.code||-32602`. The default -32602 is "Invalid params". For unknown method/tool, -32601 would be more appropriate, but the test only checks `assert.rejects` so any throw works. I'll keep it simple with thrown errors.

